"--- calculator-skills · seed 1 · difficulty 1
prompt   Which key sequence gives this result?
display  inline "72" calculator {"operation":"choose-sequence","target":{"n":72,"d":1},"candidates":[{"id":"sequence-1","keys":[2,"add",6,"multiply",9,"enter"]},{"id":"sequence-0","keys":["(",2,"add",6,")","multiply",9,"enter"]}]}
answer   choice sequence-0
input    choice
hint     Parentheses make the addition happen before multiplication.
choice   sequence-1 = 2+6×9 ENTER
choice   sequence-0 = (2+6)×9 ENTER
step 1   Add inside parentheses: 2 + 6 = 8.
step 2   Multiply: 8 × 9 = 72.
miss     ignored-parentheses = sequence-1   Parentheses make the addition happen before multiplication.

--- calculator-skills · seed 12345 · difficulty 1
prompt   Use the answer toggle to give a decimal.
display  inline "5÷8 ENTER" calculator {"operation":"answer-form","keys":[5,"divide",8,"enter"],"form":"decimal"}
