keypad   allowFraction=true allowDecimal=true
hint     The answer toggle switches between fraction and decimal forms.
step 1   5 ÷ 8 = 5/8.
step 2   5/8 equals 0.625 in decimal form.
step 3   Use the answer toggle to show the decimal.

