exports[`Unit 22 content > formula-sheet records the complete output and stable intro 1`] = `
"--- formula-sheet · seed 1 · difficulty 1
prompt   Which formula finds the rectangle perimeter?
display  geometry perimeter length 6 width 5 unit m name "Rectangle with length 6 m and width 5 m" formulas ["P equals 2l plus 2w" row("P = ", "2l + 2w"); "A equals l times w" row("A = ", "lw")] formula-selection
answer   choice formula-0
input    choice
hint     Match the requested measurement to the provided formulas.
choice   formula-0 = P equals 2l plus 2w
choice   formula-1 = A equals l times w
step 1   We need the rectangle perimeter.
step 2   Choose the formula for the rectangle perimeter.
miss     other-measurement = formula-1   That formula finds the rectangle area.

