keypad   allowNegative=true maxLength=2
hint     Substitute the named input for x, then simplify the rule.
step 1   Replace x with 4.   [−3x → −3(4)]
step 2   Multiply the coefficient and input.   [−12]
step 3   Add the constant −4.   [−16]

